{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"411d5424c1909757","name":"card_event_daring_strike","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Poland/events/card_event_daring_strike","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"DARING STRIKE","text":"Costs 2 less for each Exile unit you control. Deal 2 damage to any target.","flavorText":"After the annexation of Poland there were a number of Polish pilots that fled to Great Britain and started fighting for the RAF in the Battle of Britain. The Polish recruits soon earned a reputation as extraordinary pilots that often showed total disregard for their own lives in their fight against the German Luftwaffe. Driven by vengefulness they would often put their lives at risk, just to inflict damage. When their ammunition ran dry they would continue their attacks by ramming the enemy or by using the propeller to slice into the enemy aircraft until it went down. Polish pilots were also known to maneuver above German bombers and use the body of their aircraft to force them down to the ground.","faction":"Poland","type":"order","rarity":"Common","cost":4,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_daring_strike","title":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_event_daring_strike_title","SourceString":"DARING STRIKE","LocalizedString":"DARING STRIKE"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Poland","kredits":4,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_event_daring_strike_text","SourceString":"Costs 2 less for each Exile unit you control. Deal 2 damage to any target.","LocalizedString":"Costs 2 less for each Exile unit you control. Deal 2 damage to any target."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_poland","Key":"card_event_daring_strike_history","SourceString":"After the annexation of Poland there were a number of Polish pilots that fled to Great Britain and started fighting for the RAF in the Battle of Britain. The Polish recruits soon earned a reputation as extraordinary pilots that often showed total disregard for their own lives in their fight against the German Luftwaffe. Driven by vengefulness they would often put their lives at risk, just to inflict damage. When their ammunition ran dry they would continue their attacks by ramming the enemy or by using the propeller to slice into the enemy aircraft until it went down. Polish pilots were also known to maneuver above German bombers and use the body of their aircraft to force them down to the ground.","LocalizedString":"After the annexation of Poland there were a number of Polish pilots that fled to Great Britain and started fighting for the RAF in the Battle of Britain. The Polish recruits soon earned a reputation as extraordinary pilots that often showed total disregard for their own lives in their fight against the German Luftwaffe. Driven by vengefulness they would often put their lives at risk, just to inflict damage. When their ammunition ran dry they would continue their attacks by ramming the enemy or by using the propeller to slice into the enemy aircraft until it went down. Polish pilots were also known to maneuver above German bombers and use the body of their aircraft to force them down to the ground."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Legions","isReserved":true,"usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardEnterPlay","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardLeaveBoardOrOwner","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardSuppressed"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Intel"],"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_3'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/War_UI/Waves/Drum_Movements/War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_3.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Poland/t_polish_air_order.t_polish_air_order","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Alamy Stock Photo","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/DARING_STRIKE.DARING_STRIKE","SubPathSt